msgid ""
"Template %(template_name)s is necessary for appraisal requests and may not "
"be removed."
msgstr ""
"ແມ່ແບບ %(template_name)s ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການຮ້ອງຂໍການປະເມີນ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/models/hr_appraisal.py:0
msgid ""
"Thanks to your Appraisal Plan, without any new manual Appraisal, the new "
"Appraisal will be automatically created on %s."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກແຜນການປະເມີນຂອງທ່ານ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງການປະເມີນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃໝ່, ການປະເມີນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແບ"
"ບອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນວັນທີ %s."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/models/hr_appraisal.py:0
msgid "The appraisal's status has been set to Done by %s"
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງການປະເມີນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນສຳເລັດແລ້ວໂດຍ %s"

#. module: hr_appraisal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_appraisal.field_hr_appraisal_goal__usual_duration_month
msgid ""
"The average timing for the goals to be completed. It will populate the "
"estimated end date when assigned"
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະເວລາສະເລ່ຍໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປົ້າໝາຍສຳເລັດ. ລະບົບຈະກຳນົດວັນທີສິ້ນສຸດໂດຍປະມານເມື່ອມີການມອບໝາຍ"

#. module: hr_appraisal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_appraisal.field_hr_employee__next_appraisal_date
msgid ""
"The date of the next appraisal is computed by the appraisal plan's dates "
"(first appraisal + periodicity)."
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີຂອງການປະເມີນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປແມ່ນຄຳນວນຈາກວັນທີຂອງແຜນການປະເມີນ (ການປະເມີນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ + ຄວາມຖີ່)."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:hr_appraisal.constraint_res_company_positif_number_months
msgid "The duration time must be bigger or equal to 1 month."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາຕ້ອງເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1 ເດືອນ."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/models/hr_appraisal.py:0
msgid ""
"The employee %(employee)s arrived %(months)s months ago. The appraisal is "
"created and you can fill it here."
msgstr ""
"ພະນັກງານ %(employee)s ໄດ້ເຂົ້າເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອ %(months)s ເດືອນກ່ອນ. ການປະເມີນໄດ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ "
"ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/models/hr_appraisal.py:0
msgid "The employee feedback cannot be changed by managers."
msgstr "ຄຳຕິຊົມຂອງພະນັກງານບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໂດຍຫົວໜ້າໄດ້."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/static/src/fields/boolean_confirm.js:0
msgid ""
"The employee's feedback will be published without their consent. Do you "
"really want to publish it? This action will be logged in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳຕິຊົມຂອງພະນັກງານຈະຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍິນຍອມຈາກພວກເຂົາ. ທ່ານແນ່ໃຈບໍ່ວ່າຕ້ອງການເຜີຍແຜ່? ການ"
"ດຳເນີນການນີ້ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນລະບົບ."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/wizard/hr_appraisal_campaign_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The following employees already have appraisals on %(appraisal_date)s: %"
"(employees)s. The existing appraisals will be used instead of creating new "
"ones."
msgstr ""
"ພະນັກງານຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີການປະເມີນໃນວັນທີ %(appraisal_date)s ແລ້ວ: %(employees)s. ຈະໃຊ້ການປະເມີນ"
"ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແທນທີ່ຈະສ້າງໃໝ່."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/models/hr_appraisal.py:0
msgid ""
"The last appraisal of %(employee)s was %(months)s months ago. The appraisal "
"is created and you can fill it here."
msgstr ""
"ການປະເມີນຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງ %(employee)s ແມ່ນເມື່ອ %(months)s ເດືອນກ່ອນ. ການປະເມີນໄດ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້"
"ວ ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້."

#. module: hr_appraisal
