"You cannot delete an employee who is a goal's manager, archive it instead."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບພະນັກງານທີ່ເປັນຫົວໜ້າຄຸ້ມຄອງເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການເກັບເຂົ້າສາງແທນ."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/models/hr_appraisal_goal.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot duplicate at the same time a goal and one of its children.\n"
"Duplicating a goal will also duplicate its children."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສຳເນົາເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ ລາຍການຍ່ອຍພ້ອມກັນໄດ້.\n"
"ການສຳເນົາເປົ້າໝາຍຈະສຳເນົາລາຍການຍ່ອຍໄປພ້ອມ."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/models/hr_appraisal.py:0
msgid "You cannot modify a finished appraisal."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂການປະເມີນທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວໄດ້."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid "You cannot set 'Next Appraisal Date' in the past."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດ 'ວັນທີປະເມີນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ' ເປັນວັນທີໃນອະດີດໄດ້."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/models/hr_appraisal.py:0
